# Redis
# Cap below 8.0: redis-py 8.0.0 broke Django Channels — it mis-maps the
# asyncio cancellation of an in-flight blocking BZPOPMIN (normal operation in
# channels_redis await_many_dispatch) into redis.exceptions.TimeoutError, which
# bubbles up to uvicorn and drops the WebSocket connection (~every few minutes
# per idle client). redis-py 7.4.x works correctly with channels_redis 4.3.0.
# See redis-py issue #4091. Remove the cap once channels_redis supports 8.x.
redis>=7.4,<8

