# AI — заявка normalisation (client uploads any file → Claude extracts our schema)
# Floor raised from >=0.40: every AI feature (sourcing/services_ai.py, crm/services/ai_chat.py,
# catalog/ai_enrich.py, services_ai_preflight.py) calls messages.create(output_config={'format':
# {'type':'json_schema',...}}). The old >=0.40 floor predates the Structured-Outputs output_config.format
# API, so a fresh install could resolve an SDK that silently ignores the schema → unconstrained "dirty"
# JSON. 0.111 is the version verified working in the container (matches output_config.format). Cap below
# 1.0 to avoid an unvetted breaking major.
anthropic>=0.111,<1

